# Paths withheld from the public mirror (github.com/PeganaHQ/Pegana).
# Single source of truth, read by scripts/mirror-public.sh and its test.
#
# Syntax: one pattern per line, relative to the repo root. Blank lines and
# lines starting with # are ignored.
#   foo/bar/     a trailing slash excludes the whole directory
#   foo/*.md     a glob; * also matches across / (shell `case` semantics)
#   foo.md       an exact file path
#
# Before adding a pattern, check that no public README or docs link points
# into it: scripts/tests/mirror-public.test.sh scans for that.

# Hand-off and agent scaffolding
PR_BODY.md
CLAUDE.md

# Internal planning, research and operations material
docs/superpowers/
docs/design-research/
docs/operations/
docs/archive/

# Security audits (findings stay private until resolved and cleared)
docs/security/audit-*.md

# Dated production runbooks (real hosts, paths, incident detail)
docs/ops/2026-*.md
docs/ops/lst-cleanup/

# Landing-page working documents
docs/landing-remake-spec.md
docs/landing-remake-references.md
docs/verification-2026-10-18.md
